{"pageid":4901,"title":"Lightning Bane Cave","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lightning Bane Cave</span>","revid":21056,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Lightning Bane Cave is a located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a> Taiga, behind <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>. It is unlocked by having lightning strike 4 lightning rods (done by using <a href=\"/wiki/Michael%27s_Copper_Axe\" title=\"Michael&#39;s Copper Axe\">Michael's copper axe</a>. Once opened it stays open for the entirety of the server's runtime.\n</p><p>This location is primarily used to craft the <a href=\"/wiki/Lightningbane\" title=\"Lightningbane\">lightningbane</a> pickaxe. Once someone crafts it, it can not be crafted by anyone else in that server.\n</p><p>Disclaimer: Attempting to unlock this area may take multiple copper axes and a few hours of waiting for thunderstorms and lightning strikes.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902090958\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4901-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902090958 and revision id 21056. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay","exists":true},{"title":"Lightningbane","exists":true},{"tit